        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x}{3}-1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{6}-x\\right)&=\\frac{2x}{6}-1\\\\&=\\frac{x}{3}-1\\end{align*}$$",
